   "source": [
    "# Linear Regression 线性回归\n",
    "\n",
    "- Linear Regression 线性回归定义式\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\hat{y}=f_{w,b}(x)=wx+b\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$\\hat{y}$ 为预测值，$w$ 为权重，$b$ 为偏置\n",
    "\n",
    "- Cost Function 代价函数定义式\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "J(w,b)=\\frac{1}{2m}\\sum_{i=1}^{m}\\left(f_{w,b}\\left(x^{(i)}\\right)-y^{(i)}\\right)^2\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "$m$ = number of training examples"
   ]
  }
 ],
